WEBVTT

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.650
In the beginning, was the lard.

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:16.820
Rise of the Planet of the Lard.

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:20.750
It was filled with lard.

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:29.300
The cradle that raised living things from the lard.

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:37.220
Time passed and animals of Cambrian - no, Camblardian - period exploded in growth.

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:39.970
The evolution of lard accelerated.

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:42.520
Lard left its name in history.

00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:52.740
Just a little, if I take away the lard, all is lost.

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:01.790
A full moon...

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:03.830
It's so beautiful.

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:08.380
But... Full Lard is more beautiful.

00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:12.710
Shined upon by the beautiful Lard, my mind and body rest in peace.

00:01:14.970 --> 00:01:18.800
Don't you think so, commoners?

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:23.030
I feel like puking just from looking at the moon.

00:01:23.030 --> 00:01:24.020
I'm getting heartburns...

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:26.440
The Lard is so big...

00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:31.270
Once, the Earth was frozen.

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:33.900
Snowball Earth...

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:36.400
A world filled with snow and ice.

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:41.030
The Earth fell into its next phrase, Lardball Earth.

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:45.080
The world filled with Lard!

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:50.130
Taking all the lard in the world and releasing it...

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:53.210
The Lard will be the finishing blow to the Earth.

00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:56.970
Its thickness on average can span over a few thousand meters!

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:58.260
Oink!

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:01.220
Imagine. Invoke our imagination.

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:03.220
The view of the Lard...

00:02:03.220 --> 00:02:06.640
Imagine the new world fate takes us to.

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:07.980
Oink.

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:12.520
I can't imagine anything, Phantom Thief Blackie.

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:16.240
I'll catch you, Phantom Thief Blackie.

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:17.530
Blackie.

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:21.120
Boast while you can, Phantom Thief Blackie.

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:26.160
Don't you give me names on your own, ignorant girls.

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:29.670
Only a god can give himself his name.

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:32.000
I'll give myself my name.

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:35.000
My name is... God.

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:37.550
God of Lard.

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:41.340
The God that will rule the new world.

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:42.600
God of...

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:43.510
...Lard!?

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:45.470
He named himself the God...

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:48.640
You powerless girls sure are noisy.

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:55.270
Well now, it's quieted down.

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:57.900
Time for me to prepare for the toast of the new world.

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:02.240
We don't need wine before our meal. We'll quietly spread the Will of Lard.

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:06.120
A legendary Lard... I'll offer you that.

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:08.290
It'll be my Lard.

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:14.080
It's 100% fresh juice from Nero Wolfe.

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:16.050
Gramps...

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:17.960
The path to Eden.

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:20.300
Go to Eden of Lard.

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:29.390
W-Wait!

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:31.940
I'm within the universe.

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:34.440
The universe is within the God.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:36.770
The God is within the Lard.

00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:41.030
Finally, Lard is within my hands.

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:49.950
This is the legendary Lard.

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:02.260
Like I'll let you eat the treasure of my ancestor!

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:04.260
So you're still alive.

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:06.350
We can't be beaten!

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:09.390
The Web of Lard will capture everything!

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:11.930
Web of Lard!

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:17.110
He can use such a move!?

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:22.110
He's here!

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:23.530
Run!

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:26.620
The Fletching of Lard will pierce everything!

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:29.330
Fletching of Lard!

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:37.920
The national treasure of England.

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:39.750
The Sword of Beowulf!

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:40.840
No!

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:42.760
It is now mine.

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:44.970
Powerful being...

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:48.930
Only powerful beings can take on powerful enemies.

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:50.060
But...

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:53.270
My enemies are far too few.

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:05.110
I forgot all about the person Britain has.

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:08.700
Puru Sonia, from Poirot Detective Academy.

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:10.620
Arsène!

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:16.750
Why are you in my country?

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:19.540
I don't have to answer your question.

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:21.880
You've made mistakes too.

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:27.840
Would you enlighten me on my mistakes?

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:32.510
I recommend you think it over carefully.

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:41.230
Everyone, run over there!

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.980
Arsène's rupan.

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:49.870
Arsène's treasures of rupan?

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:52.080
So many beautiful accessories!

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:53.410
38 caskets!

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:55.040
The 7 of hearts trump card.

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:57.500
The Water Jug and King's Love Letters!

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:59.290
Amazing! Simply amazing!

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:01.880
This is...

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:05.550
Herc, hurry! The enemy is coming!

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:08.180
Faster!

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:10.140
He's not coming...

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:11.890
Did we escape?

00:06:11.890 --> 00:06:14.010
Stand, my other self!

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:15.720
Lard!

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:19.520
No way!

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:22.190
I shall take the Legendary Lard.

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:26.030
The force of Lard crushes everything.

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:29.610
Farrow Lard Scream!

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:40.170
Would you enlighten me on my mistakes?

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:42.040
I don't have to answer you.

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:46.380
But I can tell you.

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:49.510
You were mistaken about the path.

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:51.510
The path?

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:56.220
You took the other path, in order to escape from reality.

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:01.770
You're an unexpectedly weak person.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:14.280
You're unexpectedly a weak person, as if you're a kid.

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:20.870
It's okay for kids to get help if they ask for it.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.080
But...

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:27.300
...someday they will be able to walk on their own.

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:32.050
The seniors of Milky Holmes are the same too!

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:37.350
They're advancing by crawling on all fours all the time...

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:40.890
No, they're advancing by crawling together as a party...

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:44.650
Always, they lose their path, falling behind others...

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:48.980
But they will never forget the will to move on!

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:54.660
The one who will pull them back to the right path can only be the Student Council―

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:56.530
You're the one who's mistaken!

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:03.500
They'll always be useless...

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:06.960
Always be useless...

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:09.510
We're overloaded with grease.

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:10.920
My chest hurts...

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:12.880
My body is all cringing...

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:14.590
I can see our flower garden.

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:19.350
Music slard!

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:27.150
The time for the toast has arrived!

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:32.080
Oh all of the Lard in the world, come to me!

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:35.740
The time of Lard has come!

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:42.660
Bear!?

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:45.330
Who ordered the secchino?

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:48.750
Fight!

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:50.420
So comfortable...

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:01.270
If this goes on, the Lard Impact will happen.

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:03.770
The world will end!

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:08.900
The Lard Moon is...

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:10.610
...so big...

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:11.980
It's the end.

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:15.820
Not yet...

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:18.030
Oink.

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:23.160
A toast to the Lard.

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:41.390
Amazing.

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:45.520
Lavender... A red flower with many species.

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:49.440
Not just one or two, but a flower story.

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:54.940
A faint leathery taste, mixed with dried plums...

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:58.490
An extraordinary drink with gourmet taste.

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:03.830
Irresistible... The taste of 100% lard freshness...

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.540
Ah... I understand everything.

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:12.380
You're...

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:14.960
You're... the culprit!

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:18.550
Culprit!

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.510
Well deduced.

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:27.270
But I won't allow you to hinder me any longer.

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:29.520
You're under arrest!

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:38.150
Kokoro's IQ is 140 quindecillion seventeen minus nineteen...

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:40.530
Hasegawa-san too...

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:42.030
Zenigata-san too...

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:44.530
Twenty-san too...

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:46.830
Stone River too...

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:50.370
Just one is enough.

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:52.670
Ratracool-san too...

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:54.130
Everyone...

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:56.850
Save us.

00:10:56.850 --> 00:10:58.420
They defied God.

00:10:58.420 --> 00:11:00.430
I don't know about God.

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:02.220
Do you know about God?

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:03.470
How about you?

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:06.430
Yokohama...

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:08.600
The world...

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:10.740
To protect them...

00:11:10.740 --> 00:11:11.940
We will...

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:13.690
The seniors...

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:15.690
Someday but surely...

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:18.530
...become Milky Holmes!

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:22.950
Walk by their own two feet.

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:26.830
Detective Milky Holmes...

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:41.800
Almost.

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:42.930
We did it...

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:44.930
We got back our Toys!

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:49.930
How dare you hit me!?

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:51.270
We're doing this!

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:52.060
Yeah!

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:55.520
The Lard Fist that will break everything.

00:11:55.520 --> 00:11:57.650
Destroyer of the Angry Lard!

00:11:57.650 --> 00:11:59.400
Nero, it's coming from that side!

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:00.070
Leave it to me!

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:07.120
Barrier at full power!

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:07.530
Got it!

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:10.250
The weak will be crushed.

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:15.670
It's so slimy. He'll slide off.

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:18.090
We won't be able to crush him like this.

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:18.800
Sher!

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:19.630
Yes!

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:20.510
His stomach!

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:22.170
His stomach is his weak spot!

00:12:26.180 --> 00:12:28.260
Herc, now's the time! Hold him tight!

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:30.640
He won't slide off.

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:32.390
Let go. Stop it!

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:33.810
Sorry!

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:44.490
W-We did it.

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:46.780
We saved Yokohama.

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:48.530
We got back our Toys.

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:50.700
As expected of us!

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:55.920
Not yet.

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:57.130
Not yet, oink.

00:12:58.670 --> 00:12:59.590
Oh, Lard.

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:01.590
Oh, my Lard.

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:03.840
I am God.

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:05.840
God of Lard.

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:07.340
Lard is God.

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:08.930
God is Lard.

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:12.470
Lard... Larder... Lardest!

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:18.100
He's being eaten.

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:21.110
T-There's still more fight in him?

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:34.250
Wings of Lard!

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:36.210
Wings of Lard?

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:37.250
Pigarus?

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:39.460
Icarus, from the Greek mythology.

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:40.960
Gladius!

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:42.300
Aegis!

00:13:43.170 --> 00:13:46.630
I'll defeat you before I create the new Lard World.

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:47.840
That weak barrier won't block my attacks.

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:51.890
Fire! Fire! Fire! Fire! Fire!

00:13:58.190 --> 00:13:59.480
It won't work against me.

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:01.360
The weak will be crushed.

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:05.240
Don't you have any trump cards, Cordelia!?

00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:06.950
I don't really have any...

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:08.360
You're really unreliable.

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:10.780
Why must I take that from you!?

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:13.120
Now now, don't fight.

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:14.620
Um... Everyone...

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:16.160
What's the matter, Herc-san?

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:17.660
This...

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:18.960
What's that thing?

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:22.630
A treasure from Arsène's rupan.

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:23.750
Wheat Straw.

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:25.010
Wheat straw?

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:27.470
What would that serve? Feed it to animals?

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:28.800
Now's not the time.

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:29.930
Read the atmosphere!

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:31.720
It had this explanation.

00:14:31.980 --> 00:14:38.730
Legend says that Phantom Thief Rupan sucked the Toys of his opponents using this straw.

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:41.940
Then, if we can suck his all-powerful Toys...

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:43.520
His attack stopped!

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:44.610
He's coming!

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:46.070
From behind?

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:46.940
No, not correct.

00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:47.780
From the right?

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:48.700
From the left?

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:49.320
Where is he?

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:51.110
He's below!?

00:14:51.110 --> 00:14:52.780
How slow can you be?

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:55.410
Time for the finale.

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:00.460
Get away from me.

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:03.380
Please save the seniors...

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:08.720
Strength is the power that oneself overlooks.

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:10.800
Power that surpasses egoism!

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:20.890
Time for me to end this meaningless battle.

00:15:20.890 --> 00:15:23.690
Away with the darkness of the new Lard World!

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:29.030
Who are you?

00:15:30.650 --> 00:15:33.110
So bright!

00:15:33.110 --> 00:15:36.830
My Wings of Lard are melting!

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:38.790
The night turned into day!

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:39.830
What's happening?

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:41.920
That just means justice trumps over evil!

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:43.460
He's exactly like the real Icarus.

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:44.460
No way.

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:46.840
How could this be? Everything should have been successful!

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:50.260
Let go! Oink!

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:51.680
Don't struggle.

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:55.760
I'll suck your Toys out!

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:57.720
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

00:15:57.720 --> 00:15:59.520
Should I really do it?

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:00.430
Hurry up, Sher!

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:01.520
Do it now, Sher!

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:04.480
Are you really sucking!

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:06.980
Suck harder!

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:09.440
This scene looks really disgusting.

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:12.240
Do it! All you need to do is to suck harder!

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:14.700
I'll protect Yokohama.

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:21.080
It's not working at all!

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:23.160
Shouldn't it be able to suck out Toys?

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:25.130
We were deceived!

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:27.380
We're detectives!

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:29.420
We'll save Yokohama!

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:31.130
Please give me the power!

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:33.300
Put your trust in it.

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:37.510
Without trying to save Yokohama...

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:42.180
...or thinking of saving the whole world, give it your all.

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:45.690
If you can't do that... you can't possibly...

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:52.530
Bl-ow.

00:16:52.990 --> 00:16:53.820
Blow?

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:57.530
The legend was passed down wrongly?

00:16:57.530 --> 00:16:59.530
Let's blow with all our might!

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:05.960
I can feel Nero's power.

00:17:05.960 --> 00:17:08.500
Cordelia's power is burning up!

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:11.210
That's just your breath touching each other.

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:14.300
This is the sign that Milky Holmes has united as one!

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:15.430
It's a fact!

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:20.720
What's happening to me?

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:23.310
Last blow!

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:27.440
L-L-Lard!

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:30.440
Lard is coming out!

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:40.280
The lard has been released!

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:42.410
That's the end of Phantom Thief Oilishly black.

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:44.790
We saved Yokohama.

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:47.330
We released the Toys too.

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:50.420
Everyone, look at that!

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:53.380
Lard was not at fault.

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:55.550
It's the Lard God!

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:56.420
The real one?

00:17:56.420 --> 00:17:58.760
The real one is so pretty!

00:17:58.760 --> 00:18:05.890
It takes only a little bit of ill will to revive the sealed evil in lard.

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:08.730
So now I'll take this with me.

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:11.860
Please do not hate lard.

00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:14.400
Please love lard.

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:16.540
Yes!

00:18:16.540 --> 00:18:18.530
We are the lard.

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:24.830
We are the chilled lard used by many!

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:33.460
I'm so happy. I'm surrounded with lard.

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:44.260
Feast your eyes on the lard.

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:49.730
My IQ is 14 zillion!

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:51.440
18 zeros!

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:55.940
I'm Akechi Kokoro, genius beautiful girl of the police force who graduated from Harvard University!

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:58.360
Are you ready, Mr. Bean?

00:18:58.360 --> 00:19:00.030
I'm Rat!

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:01.910
Rat! R-a-t!

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:03.950
It's Arsène-sama! It's definitely her!

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:08.870
Those girls really...

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:18.970
Arsène-sama!

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:21.970
Welcome back. I have stretched my neck long waiting for you.

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:23.010
Our master!

00:19:24.100 --> 00:19:27.600
Do you still call me your master?

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:30.940
We swore loyalty to you...

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:32.980
...that we will protect you...

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:35.110
...and be your comrades!

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:37.440
That's why we formed our knighthood!

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:40.200
We're the Phantom Thief Empire.

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:45.490
We only follow you!

00:19:56.920 --> 00:19:59.010
Yokahama is glowing.

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:00.630
It's so beautiful.

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:02.300
Santa-san will be happy.

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:03.300
I'm sure!

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:08.180
Merry Lard-mas!

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:16.400
Even though I have abandoned everything, lest I know everything has come back to my hands.

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:18.400
Is this fate?

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:23.360
The feeling that pushed me to the limits just blew off.

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:27.080
Something in my heart has been ignited.

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:30.250
Can I set myself free!?

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:33.040
Next time, Henriette's return.

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:34.790
The culprit is me.

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:38.290
Now, Milky Holmes, please look forward to it.
